{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":138,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"De David. Je te célébrerai de tout mon cœur ; je chanterai tes louanges devant les dieux.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Je me prosternerai vers le temple de ta sainteté, et je célébrerai ton nom à cause de ta bonté et à cause de ta vérité ; car tu as exalté ta parole au-dessus de tout ton nom.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Au jour où j’ai crié, tu m’as répondu ; tu as augmenté la force de mon âme.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tous les rois de la terre te célébreront, ô Éternel ! quand ils auront entendu les paroles de ta bouche ;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Et ils chanteront dans les","poem":1},{"noteId":422},{"text":"voies de l’Éternel, car grande est la gloire de l’Éternel.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Car l’Éternel est haut élevé ; mais il voit ceux qui sont en bas état, et il connaît de loin les hautains.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Si je marche au milieu de la détresse, tu me feras vivre, tu étendras ta main contre la colère de mes ennemis, et ta droite me sauvera.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"L’Éternel achèvera ce qui me concerne. Éternel ! ta bonté demeure à","poem":1},{"noteId":423},{"text":"toujours. N’abandonne pas les œuvres de tes mains.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":422,"caller":"a","text":"ou : chanteront les.","reference":{"chapter":138,"verse":5}},{"noteId":423,"caller":"b","text":"litt. : [est] à.","reference":{"chapter":138,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/138.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/139.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/137.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}